                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ed1e1138-3eb8-3be2-91b4-5700cf18a768",
                        "entry_id": "3e47e442-5875-3ec5-be92-df915fdc6641",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Kraft, die in einem rotierenden System von der Drehachse nach außen gerichtet ist"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "physics"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7bb68858-44ab-4bf1-a8c2-2eeb5d723f99",
                                "sense_id": "ed1e1138-3eb8-3be2-91b4-5700cf18a768",
                                "text": "„Die Gezeiten werden auf der ganzen Welt durch das rotierende System Erde - Mond bestimmt, in dem das Wasser wechselweise durch die Anziehungskraft des Mondes (auf der dem Mond zugewandten Seite) und durch die Fliehkraft der um den gemeinsamen Schwerpunkt drehenden Erde (auf der Rückseite) ansteigt.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b599e534-4628-3f08-b569-52062b2d46d3",
                        "entry_id": "3e47e442-5875-3ec5-be92-df915fdc6641",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Drang/Tendenz, sich aus einer bestehenden Gemeinschaft zu entfernen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "figurative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "68fa7e04-dab4-428d-be4e-3f535fdff75e",
                                "sense_id": "b599e534-4628-3f08-b569-52062b2d46d3",
                                "text": "„Für ihn war es die Antwort auf die Fliehkräfte unterschiedlichster sozialer und ethnischer Gruppen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "256fac3a-1fb3-4a75-9ac8-30e79a5b2464",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e47e442-5875-3ec5-be92-df915fdc6641",
                        "source_sense_id": "ed1e1138-3eb8-3be2-91b4-5700cf18a768",
                        "source_sense_description": "Physik: Kraft, die in einem rotierenden System von der Drehachse nach außen gerichtet ist",
                        "target_lang_word": "centrifugal force",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "centrifugal force",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eb09fbf7-0d4e-3cf7-9a8e-aad7ef54591c",
                                        "entry_id": "60b20a50-e572-3222-a3cc-604df4cd5068",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In everyday understanding, the effect that tends to move an object away from the center of a circle it is rotating about (a consequence of inertia)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "11b8a2f4-0589-33a0-89cc-b458f4880b9e",
                                        "entry_id": "60b20a50-e572-3222-a3cc-604df4cd5068",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a rotating reference frame, the apparent force that seems to push all bodies away from the centre of rotation of the frame and is a consequence of the body's mass and the frame's angular speed. It works in conjunction with the Coriolis force to give correct motion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5994662-1058-4e9c-8a95-1a1c4ce0f3d2",
                                                "sense_id": "11b8a2f4-0589-33a0-89cc-b458f4880b9e",
                                                "text": "Although the Citadel is equipped with mass-effect-generating element-zero cores, most of the gravity on the station is generated by the centrifugal force of rotation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "336aee27-aaa9-321a-a245-656f56de757f",
                                        "entry_id": "60b20a50-e572-3222-a3cc-604df4cd5068",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In circular motion, the 'reactive' centrifugal force is a real force applied by the accelerating body that is equal and opposite to the centripetal force that is acting on the accelerating body."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6036e433-343c-390f-a30f-e9e090f4f380",
                                        "entry_id": "60b20a50-e572-3222-a3cc-604df4cd5068",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In polar coordinates, the apparent radial force that acts away from the center and is a consequence of the body's angular speed around the origin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5430f948-930e-35a9-95a3-26ebb89d1d24",
                                        "entry_id": "60b20a50-e572-3222-a3cc-604df4cd5068",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Centripetal force."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1d85a6ed-9232-4a75-ad5a-a3a6647d12f2",
                                                "sense_id": "5430f948-930e-35a9-95a3-26ebb89d1d24",
                                                "text": "The abolition of feudal serfdom in 1861 and the demand for wage labor created by industrialization drew large numbers of peasants to the growing cities in search of paid work. It was this centrifugal force of capitalism in Russia that centralized an urban industrial class in the 1880s and 1890s."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "448c026f-5130-4587-a555-6d8fc59ba910",
                        "source_entry_id": "3e47e442-5875-3ec5-be92-df915fdc6641",
                        "source_sense_id": "ed1e1138-3eb8-3be2-91b4-5700cf18a768",
